<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cadastrar Funcionário - Chronos</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
        }

        .navbar-chronos {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark navbar-chronos shadow-sm">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold d-flex align-items-center" href="/rh/dashboard">
                <img src="/icon.ico" alt="Logo Chronos" width="30" height="30"
                    class="d-inline-block align-text-top me-2 rounded">
                Chronos <span class="badge bg-light text-dark ms-2 fs-6 shadow-sm">RH</span>
            </a>
            <div class="d-flex">
                <a href="/rh/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">← Voltar</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-lg-5">
                <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 rounded-3">
                    <div class="card-header bg-white border-bottom-0 text-center pt-4 pb-0">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark">Novo Funcionário</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted">Preencha os dados de acesso do colaborador.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <form action="/cadastro" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">

                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold text-secondary">Nome Completo</label>
                                <input class="form-control" type="text" name="nome" placeholder="Ex: João da Silva"
                                    required>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold text-secondary">E-mail Corporativo</label>
                                <input class="form-control" type="email" name="email" placeholder="joao@empresa.com"
                                    required>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mb-4">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold text-secondary">Senha Provisória</label>
                                <input class="form-control" type="password" name="senha"
                                    placeholder="Crie uma senha de acesso" required>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mb-4 bg-light p-3 rounded border">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold text-secondary mb-2">📅 Escala de Trabalho (Dias
                                    Úteis)</label>
                                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="0"
                                            id="dia0">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia0">Dom</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="1"
                                            id="dia1" checked>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia1">Seg</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="2"
                                            id="dia2" checked>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia2">Ter</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="3"
                                            id="dia3" checked>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia3">Qua</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="4"
                                            id="dia4" checked>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia4">Qui</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="5"
                                            id="dia5" checked>
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia5">Sex</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="diasTrabalho[]" value="6"
                                            id="dia6">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="dia6">Sáb</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-text mt-2" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Marque os dias em que o
                                    funcionário deve bater ponto. O sistema gerará "Falta" caso não haja registro nestes
                                    dias marcados.</div>
                            </div>

                            <hr class="text-muted my-4">

                            <div class="mb-4 bg-light p-3 rounded border">
                                <label for="fotoReferencia" class="form-label fw-bold text-primary mb-1">
                                    📸 Foto de Referência (IA)
                                </label>
                                <input id="fotoReferencia" class="form-control form-control-sm" type="file"
                                    name="fotoReferencia" accept="image/*">
                                <div class="form-text text-muted mt-2" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">
                                    Opcional no cadastro. Se não enviar agora, o ponto facial ficará bloqueado até que a
                                    foto seja anexada depois.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <button class="btn btn-success btn-lg w-100 fw-bold" type="submit">Cadastrar
                                Funcionário</button>

                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>